   <ThingDef ParentName="SK_PlantFoodRawBase">
    <defName>RawIcecap</defName>
    <label>raw Icecap</label>
    <description>The harvested "head" resembles a dense, conical blue cabbage, but the leaves are not wavy, but smooth and glossy, as if covered with a thin film of ice. The color is an intense electric blue, with a neon glow in the center and veins, especially noticeable at dusk. When touched, the leaves produce a characteristic high-pitched crunch, comparable to the breaking of layered ice.</description>
